    rating_indicators: `Good: Care plans are detailed and reviewed. Training is complete and staff demonstrate competency. MCA and DoLS are correctly applied. Nutritional needs are identified and met. Healthcare access is proactive and timely. Requires Improvement: Care plans generic or out of date, training incomplete or staff unable to demonstrate competency, MCA assessments missing, DoLS not applied where needed, healthcare referrals delayed.`,
    source_urls: ['https://www.cqc.org.uk/guidance-providers/residential-adult-social-care/key-question-effective'],
